#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:49
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:34
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"This step-by-step tutorial is intended for beginners who followed the "
"complete :ref:`doc_step_by_step`."
msgstr ""
"Este tutorial passo a passo é voltado para iniciantes que seguiram o guia "
"completo :ref:`doc_step_by_step`."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:54
msgid ""
"If you're an experienced programmer, you can find the complete demo's source "
"code here: `Dodge the Creeps source code <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/dodge_the_creeps>`__."
msgstr ""
"Se você é um programador experiente, pode encontrar o código fonte completo "
"da demonstração aqui: `Código Fonte Dodge the Creeps <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/dodge_the_creeps>`__."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.rst:58
