"depois de ``public partial class Player : Area2D``:"

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/03.coding_the_player.rst:365
msgid ""
"This defines a custom signal called \"hit\" that we will have our player "
"emit (send out) when it collides with an enemy. We will use ``Area2D`` to "
"detect the collision. Select the ``Player`` node and click the :ui:`Signals` "
"tab next to the Inspector tab to see the list of signals the player can emit:"
msgstr ""
