msgstr ""
"O aplicativo de exemplo usa `Fragments <https://developer.android.com/guide/"
"fragments>`_ para organizar sua interface de usuário, por isso ele usa o "
"`GodotFragment <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/"
"android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/GodotFragment.java>`_, um "
"componente de fragmento fornecido pela biblioteca Android do Godot para "
"hospedar e gerenciar automaticamente a instância do Godot Engine."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:142
msgid ""
"The Godot Android library also provide `GodotActivity <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/"
"godot/GodotActivity.kt>`_, an Activity component that can be extended to "
"automatically host and manage the Godot Engine instance."
msgstr ""
"A biblioteca Android do Godot também fornece a `GodotActivity <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/GodotActivity.kt>`_, um componente de Activity que pode "
"ser estendido para hospedar e gerenciar automaticamente a instância do Godot "
"Engine."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:144
msgid ""
"Alternatively, applications can directly create a `Godot <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/"
"godot/Godot.kt>`_ instance, host and manage it themselves."
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, os aplicativos podem criar diretamente uma instância do "
"`Godot <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/platform/android/"
"java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/Godot.kt>`_, hospedá-la e gerenciá-la por "
"conta própria."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:146
msgid ""
"Using `GodotHost#getHostPlugins(...) <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-"
"Android-Samples/blob/0e3440f357f8be5b4c63a4fe75766793199a99d0/apps/"
