"Godot offers a first-party ``GodotGooglePlayBilling`` Android plugin "
"compatible with Godot 4.2+ which uses the `Google Play Billing library "
"<https://developer.android.com/google/play/billing>`_."
msgstr ""
"O Godot oferece um plugin oficial do Android ``GodotGooglePlayBilling`` "
"compatível com o Godot 4.2+ que usa a `biblioteca do Google Play Billing "
"<https://developer.android.com/google/play/billing>`_."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_in_app_purchases.rst:15
msgid ""
"Make sure you have enabled and successfully set up :ref:`Android Gradle "
"Builds <doc_android_gradle_build>`. Follow the installation instructions on "
"the ``GodotGooglePlayBilling`` `github page <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-google-play-billing>`__."
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de ter ativado e configurado com sucesso as :ref:`Compilações "
"Gradle do Android <doc_android_gradle_build>`. Siga as instruções de "
"instalação na `página do github <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-google-"
"play-billing>`__ do ``GodotGooglePlayBilling``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_in_app_purchases.rst:20
msgid "Initialize the plugin"
msgstr "Inicializar o plugin"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_in_app_purchases.rst:22
