msgid ".NET desktop development"
msgstr "Desenvolvimento para desktop com .NET"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.rst:171
msgid ""
"Set **Dotnet** -> **Editor** -> **External Editor** to **Visual Studio**."
msgstr ""
"Defina **Dotnet** -> **Editor** -> **External Editor** para **Visual "
