"a list of bones described in key-value pairs in the format ``bones/<id>/"
"<attribute> = value``. The bone attributes consist of:"
msgstr ""
"O nó :ref:`class_Skeleton3D` herda o nó Node3D, mas também pode ter uma "
"lista de ossos descritos em pares chave-valor no formato ``bones/<id>/"
"<attribute> = value``. Os atributos de osso consistem em:"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/file_formats/tscn.rst:204
msgid "``position``: Vector3"
msgstr "``position``: Vector3"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/file_formats/tscn.rst:205
msgid "``rotation``: Quaternion"
msgstr "``rotation``: Quaternion"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/file_formats/tscn.rst:206
msgid "``scale``: Vector3"
msgstr "``scale``: Vector3"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/file_formats/tscn.rst:208
msgid ""
"These attributes are all optional. For instance, a bone may only define "
"``position`` or ``rotation`` without defining the other properties."
msgstr ""
"Esses atributos são todos opcionais. Por exemplo, um osso pode definir "
